<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.KOREA SHIPPING - STEEL SCRAP CARGOES - AUG 13.</title>
<headline>S.KOREA SHIPPING - STEEL SCRAP CARGOES - AUG 13.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the arrival schedule for major steel scrap vessels unloading at South Korean ports of Inchon, Pusan, Masan, Pohang, Kwangyang and Asan, as detailed on Wednesday by South Korean surveyors.</p>
<p>Steel scrap cargoes</p>
<p>-- INCHON PORT</p>
<p> VESSEL	    TONNE    ETA	 ETD	  BUYER</p>
<p> Rova		38,391   Aug  4    Aug  18    Inchon</p>
<p> Jade Pacific    35,000   Aug  5    Aug  30    Inchon</p>
